fon# Fonts

My personal collection of typography.

## usage

I do not wish to clutter my git repository with several hundred megabytes
worth of data, so I have relocated this collection to my [Google Drive](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TW8uIThUK6V8z91qvfbU9SVSG2WLDpRo/view?usp=share_link).

### setup

I have created a stow package to aid in setting up our user's
local file paths.

```shell
#cd ~/dotfiles.git
stow -Rv fonts
fc-cache --verbose
fc-query 'Open Sans'
```

